Description: Professional Android logical forensic acquisition tool for Kali Linux
 JullForensics is an enterprise digital forensics solution adhering strictly
 to ISO/IEC 27037, ISO/IEC 27041, ISO/IEC 27042, ISO/IEC 27050, and
 ISO/IEC 17025 standards.
 .
 Features include:
  - 100% Python implementation with zero third-party Java/C# dependencies
  - Real-time ADB device connection monitoring via push streaming
  - In-RAM forensic screenshot capture with FLAG_SECURE detection
  - POSIX PAX .tar container generation with dual SHA-256/SHA-512 streaming hashes
  - Tamper-evident chained audit log with HMAC-SHA256 and Ed25519 digital signatures
  - High-contrast brutalist desktop GUI (WCAG 2.2 AA compliant)
  - Tripartite judicial reporting (PDF, HTML, JSON)
